---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SubscribeCta from '../components/SubscribeCta.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn more about Save Room and its philosophy of making space for what matters.">
  <section class="about-hero container"><div class="eyebrow">A note from Save Room</div><h1>A home can hold<br /><em>more than things.</em></h1><p>It can hold your routines, your people, your unfinished projects, and the version of yourself you’re making room to become.</p></section>
  <section class="about-body"><div class="container about-grid"><div class="big-number">01</div><div><div class="eyebrow">The idea</div><h2>Make the everyday<br />feel a little lighter.</h2><p>Save Room is a place for practical inspiration around organizing, resetting, and living well in the spaces you already have. No perfection required. No one-size-fits-all systems. Just small, useful shifts that help your home support your life.</p><a class="button button--dark" href="https://www.youtube.com/@saveroomorg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Meet us on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="principles section container"><div class="eyebrow">Our north stars</div><div class="principle-grid"><div><span>01</span><h3>Useful over perfect</h3><p>A system only works if it works for your actual life.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Less pressure, more progress</h3><p>Small steps count. Especially the ones you can keep.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Room for the real stuff</h3><p>A beautiful home is still allowed to be lived in.</p></div></div></section>
  <SubscribeCta />
</BaseLayout>
<style>.about-hero{padding-top:100px;padding-bottom:110px}.about-hero h1{margin:24px 0}.about-hero h1 em{color:var(--terracotta)}.about-hero>p{max-width:43ch;font-size:1.2rem}.about-body{padding:90px 0;color:var(--cream);background:var(--olive)}.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:180px 1fr;gap:40px}.big-number{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:6rem;color:var(--coral);line-height:.8}.about-body h2{margin:15px 0 22px}.about-body p{max-width:52ch;color:rgba(247,243,236,.75);font-size:1.05rem}.principles>.eyebrow{margin-bottom:40px}.principle-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px}.principle-grid span{color:var(--terracotta);font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}.principle-grid h3{margin:15px 0 10px}.principle-grid p{font-size:.9rem}@media(max-width:680px){.about-hero{padding-top:70px;padding-bottom:80px}.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.big-number{font-size:4rem}.principle-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
